{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"doug-cockle","name":"Doug Cockle","birthDate":"1970-09-16","birthPlace":"Twentynine Palms, California, USA","bio":"Doug Cockle is an American actor and director. He is currently working as a freelance actor.\n\nCockle is known for his voice-over roles in video games, most notably of Geralt of Rivia in The Witcher series. He was nominated for a Game Award for Best Performance and won Golden Joystick Award Best Gaming Performance for his portrayal of Geralt in The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt.\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Doug Cockle, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-16T12:07:00+00:00","tmdbId":1047370,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/1047370","credits":[{"id":"cap-first","title":"Captain America: The First Avenger","character":"Young Doctor"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/doug-cockle.webp","filmography":[{"name":"The Witcher: Sirens of the Deep","year":2025,"character":"Geralt (voice)","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/y0pR5aBVvPn5uncaZjl94ZEnuEF.jpg"},{"name":"The Amateur","year":2025,"character":"CIA Security Agent","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/SNEoUInCa5fAgwuEBMIMBGvkkh.jpg"},{"name":"Predator: Killer of Killers","year":2025,"character":"Einar (voice)","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2XDQa6EmFHSA37j1t0w88vpWqj9.jpg"},{"name":"Jay Kelly","year":2025,"character":"Nathan","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lEXYpY9X17pGC7xYYy17Guv0L3J.jpg"},{"name":"Natural Six","year":2024,"character":"Kelnys","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4iyRiRNXQszMdWYERRpP2g64JBc.jpg"},{"name":"Natural Six: Action Surge","year":2024,"character":"Self","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4iyRiRNXQszMdWYERRpP2g64JBc.jpg"},{"name":"Future TX","year":2022,"character":"Dylan's Dad","mediaType":"movie","pos